    "title": "Texans Can Now See A Super Rare Sky Event - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Texans Can Now See A Super Rare Sky Event\nBy Dubba G,\n8 hours agoSomething amazing, that hasn't been seen in decades, is happening in the night sky and Texas is one of the places where it can be seen with the naked eye. Right now, an extremely rare, stellar event is taking place. A \"Nova\" occurs when a star, thanks to, basically, a thermonuclear eruption, suddenly flares up and burns extra bright for weeks or months before fading back to its original state. Viewing one is pretty rare.",
